<title>USA: Environmental Tech names president.</title>
<headline>Environmental Tech names president.</headline>
<dateline>LAKEWOOD, N.J. 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Environmental Technologies Corp said Wednesday it named Jim Burns as president of the firm.  </p>
<p>Burns will remain as president of the company's Environmental Materials Corp automotive subsidiary when he assumes his new post, it said.</p>
<p>Burns replaces Mitchell Dong, who resigned in November to pursue other professional interests, a spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>Environmental is a supplier of refrigerant, refrigerant recovery and reclamation services, refrigerant recovery and recycling and equipment and a recycler of PCB ballasts.</p>
